<title>USA: US Budget chairmen tell reporters to stick around.</title>
<headline>US Budget chairmen tell reporters to stick around.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>House Budget Committee Chairman John Kasich cautioned reporters to be around later in the day when asked Friday about the prospects for a balanced budget deal.</p>
<p>&quot;If you are thinking of going to the beach today I would delay it for a little,&quot; said Kasich.</p>
<p>Senate Budget Committee Chairman Pete Domenici laughed when he heard Kasich's reply and added &quot;that's right.&quot;</p>
</text>
